            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hurewicz+homomorphism"}> Hurewicz homomorphism
                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Boardman+homomorphism"} Boardman homomorphism
          %h2#references References
          %p
            (For more see the references at
            = succeed ".)" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+%28Eilenberg-Steenrod%29+cohomology"} generalized (Eilenberg-Steenrod) cohomology
          %p Original articles include
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/George+Whitehead"}> George Whitehead
              ,
              %em Generalized homology theories
              (1961) (
              %a{:href => "http://www.maths.ed.ac.uk/~aar/papers/gww9.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p Textbook accounts include
          %ul
            %li#Kochmann96
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stanley+Kochmann"}> Stanley Kochmann
                , section 3.4 of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bordism%2C+Stable+Homotopy+and+Adams+Spectral+Sequences"} Bordism, Stable Homotopy and Adams Spectral Sequences
            %li#Switzer75
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Switzer"}> Robert Switzer
                , chapter 7 (and 8-12) of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Algebraic Topology - Homotopy and Homology
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefan+Schwede"}> Stefan Schwede
                , chapter II, section 6 of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Symmetric+spectra"} Symmetric spectra
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.math.uni-bonn.de/~schwede/SymSpec-v3.pdf"} pdf
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Friedrich+Bauer"}> Friedrich Bauer
                ,
                %em Classifying spectra for generalized homology theories
                Annali di Maternatica pura ed applicata
              %p (IV), Vol. CLXIV (1993), pp. 365-399
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Friedrich+Bauer"}> Friedrich Bauer
                ,
                %em Remarks on universal coefficient theorems for generalized homology theories
                Quaestiones Mathematicae
              %p Volume 9, Issue 1 &amp; 4, 1986, Pages 29 - 54
          %p
            A general construction of homologies by “geometric cycles” similar to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Baum-Douglas+geometric+cycles"} Baum-Douglas geometric cycles
            for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/K-homology"} K-homology
            is discussed in
          %ul
            %li
              S. Buoncristiano, C. P. Rourke and B. J. Sanderson,
              = succeed "," do
                %em A geometric approach to homology theory
          %p
            Further generalization of this to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bivariant+cohomology+theories"} bivariant cohomology theories
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              Martin Jakob,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Bivariant theories for smooth manifolds
